			"notes": "# Note\n\nThere is no Paper version for this release, since Paper for 1.21.5 is not out yet. However, 0.4 clients should work with 0.3 servers, if something like ViaVersion is used to make 1.21.5 clients compatible with 1.21.4 servers.\n\n# New Features\n\n* Minecraft 1.21.5 is now supported, including fallen trees, fallen leaves, and new flowers\n* The direction to a POI can now be part of POI announcements, with many different supported direction formats\n* The distance and direction to a beacon can be automatically announced periodically, or manually by pressing F8\n* Speech can be stopped any time by pressing F9\n* You can now easily disable or enable all features in the included and allowed features settings using the new buttons after the list\n* You can now edit the server config on Fabric and NeoForge dedicated servers from the client using the settings UI\n\n# Bug Fixes\n\n* In the server config, there is now a setting whether to restrict features to the ones in the allowed features list, which is disabled by default. This prevents new features introduced in an update from not being sent if the user does not edit the server config.\n* The default rolloff factor is now 0.1, making farther away points of interest more audible\n* The case of setting titles is now more consistent"
		},
