			"notes": "# Important Note\n\nThis version adds a new field to the database table. When you start Minecraft with this version of the mod, and you have a database from a previous version, the data will be migrated to a new table, which could take a minute or two. Therefore, Minecraft will take longer to start, but only for this first time.\n\n# New Features\n\n* Paper and Purpur are now supported for the server-side component\n* You can now set a radius limit on points of interest sent to clients, and block features from being sent, on Fabric, NeoForge, Paper, and Purpur\n* The mod now verifies hashes of all downloaded files to make sure they download correctly\n* You can now choose whether or not other players can see your landmarks when you create them\n* Ore veins and other usually hidden features are no longer spoken by default\n* You can reset the list of included features in the config to default by activating the button that is after the list\n\n# Bug Fixes\n\n* Duplicate feature names are no longer listed in the config, since features with the same name but different identifiers are now all stored with the same identifier\n* Some feature names have been improved"
		},
