			"notes": "# New Features\n\n* Features that generate a more detailed feature at the same location are no longer saved in the database\n* All features now have human-readable names, which are used in announcements instead of their identifiers\n* You can now filter which features are announced, and extremely common ones are excluded by default\n* You can now disable automatic POI announcements\n\n# Fixes\n\n* Distance calculations have been fixed\n* The UI screens now should look okay visually, with no overlapping controls or cut-off text\n* The database now stores integers instead of floating-point values, improving storage space and potential inaccuracies due to rounding errors"
		}
